<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-005" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi:uncle" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi:uncle:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">彪之</persName>從伯<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi:uncle:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">導</persName>謂<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi:uncle:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">彪之</persName>曰：『選曹舉汝爲尚書郎，幸可作諸王佐邪？』</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi:palace" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi:palace:m0000" ref="uke_dff_yrf">孝武</persName>寧康二年，尚書令<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin076-wangbiaozhi:palace:m0010" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">王彪之</persName>等啓改作新宮。太元三年二月，内外軍六千人始營築，至七月而成。</p>
</text>
